// Store-backed P/2 fact sources (D43). indexed(Prefix) is a dependency-free
// seek reader over the UWFI/UWIX files the shared uw_fact_index.js builder
// writes: a length-prefixed .data blob and a sorted-key .idx that is binary
// searched, so a bound-key lookup reads only the records that key touches.
// This mirrors src/unifyweaver/targets/wam_go_target.pl's seekFactSource byte
// for byte (open / lookupOffsets / readRecord / scanAll), including the
// bytes-read counter for the D43 proof, so the on-disk stores are
// interchangeable between the Go and Rust lanes. lmdb(Dir) is the opt-in tier
// and fails loudly here: the Rust lane has no repo dependency on the npm-lmdb
// (uw_fact_lmdb) store format and never silently swaps to indexed.
//
// Typed key tags (atom 0x41 / string 0x53 / int 0x49 / float 0x46) match the
// codec (scripts/js_wam/uw_fact_codec.js encodeIndexKey) so lookups find the
// right key regardless of the cell type.

